---
source: crates/yard-cli/tests/db.rs
expression: stdout(&out)
---
mysql-8.4  sleeping — yard mysql open or yard mysql shell wakes it; or yard service start mysql-8.4
  Host      127.0.0.1
  Port      3307
  User      root
  Password  (none)
  Socket    /Users/me/.yard/run/mysql-8.4.sock
  URL       mysql://root@127.0.0.1:3307

  TablePlus, Sequel Ace: open the URL, or paste it
  DBeaver, DataGrip: a new MySQL connection with the fields above
  yard mysql open [database] opens the URL in your client

For agents and scripts: yard mysql connect --json
